Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《娼妓》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.43,0:00:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,都两周了 这个烙印还痛死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two weeks and the mark's still raw as a whore's cunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.66,0:00:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 我也有相同的烙印啊 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argh, I bear the same mark, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会找这种下三滥的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without pissing about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.03,0:00:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈 哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, ha, ha, ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每次攻击过后 就疏于防守\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lower your guard after each assault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会儿 我就让你尝尝我的厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall see it raised then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的命是我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎样享受呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How shall I mount it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.23,0:01:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天身手挺灵活嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You move well today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却大失水准\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在想什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What distracts you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让Ashur送了一封信给Aurelia\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had Ashur send a letter to Aurelia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.06,0:01:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是一周过去了 毫无回音\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week past now, and no reply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望能有啥不同？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expect different?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,被丈夫骂作婊子的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman seldom rushes back to the husband{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,会回心转意才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}who calls her whore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说过这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said no such thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少口头上没说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是封忏悔信\N{\fnArial\fs30}The letter was contrite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.83,0:01:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认 当我听到她怀孕的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admitted I reacted poorly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.06,0:01:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的举止很粗暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the news of her being with child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她让你一尝等待之苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now she makes you wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.90,0:01:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人常用这招 来惩罚做了傻事的我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way women punish us for being fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.03,0:01:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想这档子事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike it from your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你真要人头落地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or find your brains upon the sand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.80,0:02:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些面具真是精美绝伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are exquisite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 它们可是家传之宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, they've been in the family for generations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.53,0:02:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常做这种安排？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this sort of arrangement happens often?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.26,0:02:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Um.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.93,0:02:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 有客人提出请求时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when such a request is made, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只会提供最佳服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}one must be prepared to offer only the finest quality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.93,0:02:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这点上 Batiatus家族做得可圈可点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The House of Batiatus does not fall short in that regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看 就这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 Diana 狩猎女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Diana, the Goddess of the Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.66,0:02:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼光真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fine choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她会批准吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think she would approve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.06,0:02:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当Actaeon看见她在洗澡时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Actaeon saw her bathing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把这可怜的家伙变成了一头鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}she turned the poor bastard into a stag{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.03,0:02:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还唆使他自己的狗去咬他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and set his own dogs upon him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.86,0:02:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 多好啊 你也可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, how fitting then, that you should have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.23,0:02:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,养一头自己的鹿来玩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}a stag of your own to play with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有主意了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you decided?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only one man I would invite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:03:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我愿意甘冒此险\N{\fnArial\fs30}such peril to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.50,0:03:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}The champion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然该是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.43,0:03:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,多加点钱都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}If more coin is required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.56,0:03:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没问题 Marcus Crassus的表亲 自然值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No the cousin to Marcus Crassus deserves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,享有「死亡之影」的屠灭者\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Slayer of Theokoles himself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.13,0:03:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,价钱合理即可\N{\fnArial\fs30}at fair price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不是钱的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it is not the price that concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psssh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一我丈夫知道 就不好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If ever my husband were to hear of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods themselves would have to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不透风的墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}whisper it in his ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.60,0:03:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在安排这方面的事情上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take the utmost care with the delicate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是力求谨慎\N{\fnArial\fs30}nature of these arrangements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,面具能确保你身份不外泄\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mask ensures anonymity, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.76,0:03:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也必须对自己负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you must also do your part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,约定时间要准时到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrive exactly at the appointed time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要带其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}unencumbered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,连奴隶和侍从也不带？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absent slaves or attendants?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就怕有人对你丈夫太过愚忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would hold your husband's loyalty truer to value.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会 呃 为你和我们的训练场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would err, avoid complications, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量规避风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you and this ludus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Ilithyia啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.93,0:04:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来早了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I early?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.70,0:04:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你请我来吃午餐的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You invited me to midday meal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.83,0:04:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 可时间是明天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. For tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是明天？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿我没打断什么重要的会谈啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray I have not interrupted important proceedings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, on the contrary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们仅仅只是在谈论你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were only just speaking about you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.73,0:04:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个凯尔特人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Celt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.23,0:04:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫Segovax\N{\fnArial\fs30}Segovax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 Segovax\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Segovax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.16,0:04:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许下次你应该多买一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should buy several next time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到掌握此中要领为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you get the hang of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个过程可不简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a difficult process.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有极少数人能熬到终极测试 能站到竞技场上的就更少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very few make it to the final test, still few the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫只看得上最强者\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband demands only the finest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As do we all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我得走了 我丈夫还等着我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive my haste, but my own husband expects me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,期待我们下次的会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look forward to our next encounter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She favors you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到我还有牵线搭桥的作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It warms the heart, to know my hands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还真让人窝心\N{\fnArial\fs30}are responsible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真该好好感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let me take them in gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要多加小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be more careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心Licinia\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Licinia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来自上层社会\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's of a strata above your station, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.16,0:05:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她情绪发生变化的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will not hesitate to remind you of it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可不会提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the minute her mood shifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她喜怒无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it shifts frequently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟这种人打多了交道 深谙此道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am well versed in dealing with such people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你要邀请我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, am I to be invited?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,邀请？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Invited?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.36,0:05:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加化装舞会啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the masquerade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我没注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I did not notice the mask{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想藏起来的那张面具？\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was attempting to conceal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.53,0:05:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么化装舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no masquerade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她仅仅是想借Diana的面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}She merely wanted to borrow the visage of Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量规避「风险」呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To avoid "complications"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.06,0:06:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个有钱贵妇跑到训练场来\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wealthy woman of status visiting a ludus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,急欲藏起面具 小声说着风险问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concealing masks and whispering of complications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不让我了解内情的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I did not know better, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会怀疑她这趟来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would suspect intent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.26,0:06:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是想跟你手下某个角斗士苟合 - Ilithyia\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to fuck one of your gladiators. - Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是她此行的目的 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is, isn't she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.16,0:06:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那个小婊子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that little whore!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.53,0:06:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,多放荡啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}How positively depraved!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应她要小心行事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised discretion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.46,0:06:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对不能把这事说出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must not breathe a word of this to anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never think it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been a most valued friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们俩的小秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this will be our little secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以掌控她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can control her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你对她和Segovax做的那样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you did with her and Segovax?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.40,0:06:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她让自己的人 去谋杀斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had her own man make attempt on Spartacus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我们的眼皮底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}under our very roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还说能够掌控她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you yet speak of control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯让她理智全无\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus inflames her beyond reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.53,0:07:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可Licinia是另一码事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia is a different matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是Ilithyia\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Ilithyia has sense enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会怕Marcus Crassus表亲的报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fear reprisal from the cousin of Marcus Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 她本来就该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humph, as she should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人金贵着呢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man shits gold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在罗马 能有这个人当靠山\N{\fnArial\fs30}To have the favor of such an ally in Rome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,跻身元老院 就指日可待了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}could pave my way to a seat in the curia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个小难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one small obstacle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia喜欢我们战神摸上去的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia favors the touch of our champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 斯巴达克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.86,0:07:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算啥难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will not be difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 他可是难缠得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's always difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的确如此 现在绝对不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a past that no longer exists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一下令…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall command…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就会乖乖听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it shall be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚战神驾到！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Champion of Capua arrives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把朱庇特吓得屁滚尿流\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who so terrifies Jupiter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,风起云涌 天降甘霖的人啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}the clouds burst and the heavens weep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.03,0:07:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的荣耀完全是主人之功\N{\fnArial\fs30}My glory is but a reflection of my Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个马屁精！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You flatter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,您对我好 我对您好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I return in kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.80,0:08:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要多谢天神眷顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the gods take notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我以为我们能更上一层楼时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just when I thought we'd accrued every accolade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.33,0:08:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,上天又降下一重考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet another falls in our laps from the heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marcus Crassus的表亲 美丽的Licinia\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair Licinia, cousin to Marcus Crassus himself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,想私下传召你\N{\fnArial\fs30}has personally requested you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.50,0:08:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crassus是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国内最有钱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richest man in the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是无上荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.26,0:08:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的对手是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's to be my opponent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对手？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Opponent?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.60,0:08:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia对你的角斗不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia has no interest in watching you fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.63,0:08:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她感兴趣的东西…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her desires are of a more…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,比较暧昧\N{\fnArial\fs30}intimate nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我和她睡觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am to lie with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.70,0:08:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要让其他男人自愧不如\N{\fnArial\fs30}And shame all men who follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,战神就得去做这些事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such things are asked of a champion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有意见？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have concern?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:09:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是卡普亚的战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the champion of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽一切战神的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall perform all duties required of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好满足她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring her to satisfaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的财运 会像你的鸡巴一样一飞冲天的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see our fortunes rise along with your cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.23,0:09:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何不适吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there discomfort?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我何时才能恢复训练？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When can I return to training?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.40,0:09:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 你还能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact that you yet walk among the living{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本身就是个奇迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a marvel in itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.43,0:09:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.43,0:09:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也或许两星期…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.00,0:09:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,明日吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.03,0:09:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 这也太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It is much too soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,明日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就明日吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,美好的一天 耽延不来啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A glorious day, long in coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.76,0:09:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,起死回生了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Risen from the dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.53,0:09:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而Ashur我 也终于摆脱束缚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Ashur, finally freed of his shackles, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要再次持剑上阵了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take up sword again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 想恢复训练？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would resume training?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一名角斗士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a gladiator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也烙有印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I yet bear the mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:10:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也渴望与兄弟们一同出生入死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And long to stand with my brothers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新屹立于竞技沙场\N{\fnArial\fs30}once more upon the sands of the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这次你该放聪明点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps this time you will have the sense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stay out of my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.56,0:10:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这破玩意从我腿上拿掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this fucking thing off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他未加拒绝吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave you no pause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.46,0:10:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的奴隶…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our dog…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于被驯服了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}is finally house broken…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.73,0:10:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很明智…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were wise…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放倒了他的女人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put down his bitch…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 哦 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohhh, oh, uh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.03,0:10:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下… 端些酒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave… and send in some wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切按计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything comes to plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.03,0:11:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia会对我们感激涕零\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall have Licinia's wet gratitude, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会传到Marcus Crassus的耳中去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with it the ear of Marcus Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是斯巴达克斯遵守承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Spartacus performs as promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的每一寸呼吸 都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every breath he takes is in service to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,与家族荣耀同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}the glory of this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他很愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he's willing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.80,0:11:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他已经很久没与女人上过床了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But its been many months since he last lay with a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一来 他的激情怕是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After such a time, his passion might be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所存无几\N{\fnArial\fs30}all too brief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 这可很糟糕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that would prove unfortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种情况很容易避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet easily avoidable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是斯巴达克斯在此之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Spartacus is presented opportunity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,多多磨炼床上技巧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hone his skills beforehand…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进错房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have wandered to the wrong cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.53,0:11:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是斯巴达克斯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you not Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,送雨的使者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringer of Rain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Mira\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Mira.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被派来慰劳你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been sent to please you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.93,0:12:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为了给你带来欢愉嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your pleasure not an end to itself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没工夫与你说笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not care for games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.23,0:12:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你的真实目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give your true purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find your tongue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina fears that you've been too long{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么久没有上过女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}without a women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怕你到时候无力支撑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you will be unable to withhold your seed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能满足那个罗马女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}long enough to please the Roman woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种念头真令人不快\N{\fnArial\fs30}The notion offends me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.73,0:12:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As does your presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not desire me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.13,0:12:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I desire only sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一夜无梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the absence of dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.93,0:13:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天神赐予我力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods grant me strength{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,挣脱枷锁 得以自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}to rip these fucking bars from their moorings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.20,0:13:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们愚蠢地以为 他们会保佑我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were fools to think they favor us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.93,0:13:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们至少还能站在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We yet share a roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是主人把我卖掉 便不会这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would not have happened if Dominus had sold me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.53,0:13:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不足以证明我们的姻缘 是上天注定的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that not proof that our union is favored?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.03,0:13:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睁睁地看着你 却无力拥有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To have you, but not have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心的伤痛难以愈合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a wound beyond healing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切皆会愈合\N{\fnArial\fs30}All wounds heal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使最深切的伤痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the deepest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.30,0:13:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人未曾经历过的切肤之痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that they had never been inflicted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.63,0:13:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不了解我的心意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would wish never to have known my heart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.10,0:14:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,战无不胜的高卢人回归了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Undefeated Gaul returns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他该选个新名字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it is time he chose a new name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你重返沙场 我情绪高昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}My spirit soars to see you again upon the sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我福大命大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The underworld would not have me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take note!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位真正的战神重返我们的队伍！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A true champion rejoins the Brotherhood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屁战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champion of ass and balls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.23,0:15:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,世间还能有第二个 像Crixus这样的男人么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has there ever been such a man as Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.93,0:15:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞美众神 让他重新回归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise the gods for his return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望众神保佑他能取得更多的胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}May they guide him to many more victories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.40,0:15:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也保佑我们钱图无量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our purse filled by such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,财源滚滚来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filled to bursting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来和Duro练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will spar with Duro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个日耳曼人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The German?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他竞技场都没进过啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has yet to step in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也久疏战阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have been long absent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.73,0:15:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过和他对抗来慢慢提高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove yourself against the man and see advancement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么谁来和我Ashur练呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who shall face Ashur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可得小心选啊 我嗜血已久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose carefully, for I long for blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能训练？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You train? - I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.96,0:15:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁告诉你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By whose word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人说过要让我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dominus himself promised{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.10,0:15:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新回到兄弟们之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I would rejoin the Brotherhood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我摆脱掉那该死的支架…\N{\fnArial\fs30}once I was freed from that fucking brace…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ashur啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.53,0:16:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}A word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人在喊他的小狗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The master calls his dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我和Hasdrubal的那场胜利么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of my victory over Hasdrubal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他脑袋切成两半时 观众叫得多疯狂啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the crowd roared when I cloved his head in two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.86,0:16:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小小胜利 早就被遗忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A minor victory, long forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那和Kleitos的那场！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kleitos, then!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者… 赢Lysimachos的… - 都多久以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or… or Lysimachos… - All long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你作为角斗士的日子 已经一去不复返了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your days as a gladiator are past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.36,0:16:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.26,0:16:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恳求您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我机会证明我还有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me prove myself yet worthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经在竞技场之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside of the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.10,0:16:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的狡诈比任何一个角斗士的剑都要锋利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cunning is sharper than any gladiator's sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.16,0:16:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会为了你愚蠢的自豪感 去冒险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not risk it on errands of foolish pride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.63,0:16:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听懂了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We in agreement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your will, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.73,0:16:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那来谈谈正事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}To business, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于Solonius 我有些想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had thoughts toward Solonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们市场的路上 边走边谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would discuss on the way to market.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有发觉Crixus回归之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you note any signs of discomfort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.13,0:17:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不舒服的迹象？\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Crixus took the sand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.43,0:17:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 主人 - 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Domina. - Uh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很渴望重新夺回自己的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's anxious to regain his place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.90,0:17:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不希望他做过头\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I would not see him overreach, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不希望他把伤痛藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor hide pain from his recovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你发现Crixus有什么事情瞒着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you notice Crixus attempting to conceal anything from me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要马上告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you tell me immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.83,0:17:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,异性可能感觉不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The opposite sex has no sense whatever{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的极限是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it comes to their limits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.66,0:17:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须一直监视他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be constantly watched, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少别让他们在做爱时受什么伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}least they harm themselves in the simple act of being men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.90,0:17:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚你和Spartacus过得怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you fare with Spartacus last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,满足后的他 阳具是不是很壮观啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was his cock of impressive size when engorged?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要了你几次？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times did he have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.73,0:17:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:18:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不愿意要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would not have me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.23,0:18:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不愿意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,到现在你才来告诉我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet you wait until now to tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕您听了会不开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid you would be displeased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把衣服脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your dress off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,乳房 臀部还有阴部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tits, ass and cunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来没有什么疾病或者畸形\N{\fnArial\fs30}All appear to be without disease or deformity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样看来问题并不出在肉体上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which tells me the fault is not in the flesh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是出现在你心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in the bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人恕罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚再去他的房间 一定要他和你做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to his cell tonight and I expect his cock in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.93,0:18:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你就永远别做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you'll find a sword in its place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.66,0:18:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里又不是竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.93,0:19:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这整个世界就是我的竞技场 傻小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is my arena, pup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要个真正的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send me a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.60,0:19:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,原地站好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Agron你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有Duro！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.36,0:19:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们负责处理这星期一半的粪便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half rations for the remainder of the week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.30,0:19:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是敢再犯 我就要你们都滚去挖矿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Test my patience again and I'll see you both to the mines!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:19:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus又交了两个朋友啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus continues making friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是没有你妻子的消息吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet no word from your wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}None forthcoming, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.86,0:20:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没有多余的钱 给Ashur来送信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no more coin to pay Ashur for the service of letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不专心训练的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will dishonor us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会蒙羞\N{\fnArial\fs30}if your mind is not on the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.43,0:20:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉那狗腿子 我来付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the jackal I will cover the cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会还你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will repay you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.06,0:20:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他离开之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he departs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ashur啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伙计跑的真快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man has run afoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许该关心你真正的对手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you'd care for a real opponent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.76,0:20:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如此渴望再回去见医生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you so eager to return to the Medicus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.23,0:20:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人召见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are summoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.33,0:20:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:21:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 下去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh, get off…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.46,0:21:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}ahhh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,多玩一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}tarry a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.80,0:21:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你主人还在集市 而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your masters yet at market, and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia还要过几个小时才来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia's not expected for several hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.53,0:21:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我的皮肤柔软吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, is my skin not soft?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.96,0:21:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让奴隶们建了个牛奶浴池\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had the slaves draw a milk bath, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.53,0:21:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我回想起 那曾经令你欢喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}recalling a time when it pleased you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起度过的时光…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we could afford such things…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 伤口还疼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, does it yet cause you pain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我却心疼到无法说出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could say the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着如此完美的你 被死亡之影摧残\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was torture to see such perfection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.93,0:21:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是心如刀割\N{\fnArial\fs30}marred by Theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.10,0:21:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你跪倒在地…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you fell to your knees…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个巨人站在你的身后时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the giant was at your back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.23,0:21:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我胸中的一颗心 被狠狠地揪起\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart seized in my chest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.93,0:21:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而后你看向主席台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you looked up to the pulvinus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.60,0:21:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看向我\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.13,0:21:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在生与死冻结的一刹那\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was of your mind, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑中在思量什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that frozen moment between life and death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.16,0:22:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,得知一位女神对我的爱意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I welcomed the afterlife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.40,0:22:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死而无憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}having know the love of a goddess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.06,0:22:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远属于我 Crixus\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will always be mine, Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.73,0:22:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯我专属\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.06,0:22:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,5个袍子 花了我双倍的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five sacks, for the price of ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次要留心烘干 贱婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see to it they are dryer this time, shit whore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.36,0:22:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后几个都发霉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last ones stank of mold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.23,0:22:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 Solonius\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not churn, good Solonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.83,0:22:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,到下一个收获季节\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thief will suffer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,物价暴跌的时候 小贼自然有得受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when prices plummet with the next harvest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.80,0:22:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷他的老二也跟着阳痿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray his cock follows the decline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.13,0:22:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没拴住你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are left off leash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.40,0:23:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的主人在别墅\N{\fnArial\fs30}My master is at his villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.23,0:23:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有事情要去办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I yet have business to attend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,奉劝一句 留意身边信得过的人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And words, searching for receptive ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.03,0:23:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的境况已有所转变\N{\fnArial\fs30}My situation has shifted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.13,0:23:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所谓的忠诚呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with it, your loyalties?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.63,0:23:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你所说 Batiatus证明自己不值得如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus proves himself unworthy, as you had divined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.93,0:23:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这等蝼蚁 怎么能与真正的伟男子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such base character seldom weighs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.63,0:23:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,相提并论\N{\fnArial\fs30}the true worth of a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你更胜一筹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it your scales are more in balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.76,0:23:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我握有价值重大的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hold valuable news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.93,0:23:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,远超过上一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond the meager recompense you offered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.83,0:23:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所付出的廉价报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}when last we spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身边的手下多了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am surrounded by jackals…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.70,0:23:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这关系到你的生命安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It concerns your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这也无法让你动心掏钱… 那算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that is no cause for you to loosen your purse… um.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.30,0:23:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.13,0:23:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的骨头挑得一干二净\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have picked my bones clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.50,0:23:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧 赶在我把血肉收回来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak, before I reclaim the meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.63,0:23:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一周的这个晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fuck the whore Despoina{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.63,0:24:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都会操Despoina那个荡妇 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}on this night every week, do you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的消息之灵通 我早已如雷贯耳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You voice what is already well known to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.03,0:24:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.36,0:24:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,换一个其他人去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send another cock in your place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.36,0:24:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你的脑袋就得跟着老二一起搬家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or see it removed along with your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.46,0:24:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus想要动手对付我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus moves against me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.10,0:24:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去给他的代理付钱 看看命令执行得如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am to pay his agent, and see the order given.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.20,0:24:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been warned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.60,0:24:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信这华丽的变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really cannot believe the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.46,0:24:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我第一次拜访你家时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I first visited your home, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.90,0:24:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到的是一个 被迫居于此地的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt great sorrow for the woman forced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.13,0:24:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,浓浓的悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}to live in such conditions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.63,0:24:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看如今的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.83,0:24:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,白玉为床金做马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrounded by opulence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.13,0:24:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以配得上 家族显赫的地位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}rivaling families of proper heritage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.03,0:24:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是些小玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trinkets merely, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.90,0:24:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的友谊相比 还是寒碜了些\N{\fnArial\fs30}not nearly so valuable as your friendship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.30,0:24:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近交了许多新朋好友啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have many new friends of late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.26,0:24:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和Licinia看起来 彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Licinia seem quite at ease{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.86,0:24:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,相处融洽呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.13,0:24:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要归功于你的引荐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for the introduction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.93,0:25:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,想喝点酒还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you care for some wine or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.76,0:25:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒已经无法吸引我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wine will not still my thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.83,0:25:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是随便开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prattle on with pleasantries, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.26,0:25:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你透露出关于Licinia的信息时\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I cannot pretend indifference{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.76,0:25:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法视而不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}to what you revealed about Licinia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.26,0:25:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不曾透露过任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I revealed nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.53,0:25:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的结论过于仓促\N{\fnArial\fs30}You jumped to conclusions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.16,0:25:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有据可循\N{\fnArial\fs30}And landed on proper footing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.93,0:25:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那以后 我对任何事都提不起兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since, I can think of nothing else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.70,0:25:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,客气地说\N{\fnArial\fs30}With respect, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.73,0:25:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia只关心自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia's passions are her own concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.23,0:25:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会在意Licinia\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mind falls not to Licinia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.33,0:25:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脑中充斥的是下作的念头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is filled with baser thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.03,0:25:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻想着粗鲁的大手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vision of brutish hands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.53,0:25:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我身上肆意游走\N{\fnArial\fs30}being laid upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.30,0:25:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某种程度上来说 我丈夫的抚摸不具备如此的野性\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a manner quite lacking in my husband's touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该说出这些想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should not speak of such things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.23,0:26:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真令自己蒙羞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dishonor myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.63,0:26:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的欲望无可厚非 无需羞愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your desires should not shame you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.76,0:26:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.30,0:26:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们女人的欲望如海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our needs are vast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.66,0:26:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须抹去这欲念\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must put my mind from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.00,0:26:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了分散注意力吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the purpose of distraction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.66,0:26:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更乐于分心其他的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preferred to discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.73,0:26:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事情会毁了我的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a thing would ruin my husband, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.16,0:26:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,败坏我父亲的名望\N{\fnArial\fs30}and taint my father's name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.16,0:26:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多像我们这般地位的人 都声称担心这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such concerns are voiced by all those who sample our wares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.13,0:26:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了Licinia 你还知道谁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you name any, save Licinia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.16,0:26:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未听说还有任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard of none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.73,0:26:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You have not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.03,0:26:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来给你安排吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I make the arrangements?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.76,0:27:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,请！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.73,0:27:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝不会失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not be disappointed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.20,0:27:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能推荐Varro吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I suggest Varro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.06,0:27:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.03,0:27:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他太平庸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, far too common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.86,0:27:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这个人必须值得冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man must equal the risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.00,0:27:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你自己的欲望源泉\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fact well known by your own desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我愿意去分享的那个人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ones that I admittedly share…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.93,0:27:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.06,0:27:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这肮脏的奴隶 出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out you filthy slave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.56,0:27:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.63,0:27:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我双耳听到家里的暴动\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ears suggest a tempest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.43,0:27:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一看 却他妈发现是老婆疯了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}but eyes reveal a wife gone fucking mad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.10,0:27:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 好好瞧瞧Ilithyia这个惹祸精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well look to Ilithyia as the cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.66,0:27:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又受到怎样新的蔑视\N{\fnArial\fs30}What new slights have prompted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.10,0:27:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,引发如此破财的大爆发？\N{\fnArial\fs30}this costly eruption?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.86,0:27:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她得知Licinia有一个角斗士床伴时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her cunt overflows at the thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.63,0:27:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的私处就泛滥成灾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Licinia bedding a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.16,0:27:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要求同等的待遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}She demands equal treatment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.20,0:27:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是她将性欲发泄到Crixus身上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she set her lust on Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.56,0:28:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的选择激怒了你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her choice droves you into rage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.26,0:28:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非她的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not her choice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.96,0:28:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她的傲慢举止惹怒了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is her manner that offends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.23,0:28:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她企图用口中的甜言蜜语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey drips from her tongue, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.53,0:28:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩饰对我们撕咬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to conceal the bite of piss{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.03,0:28:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,切肤之痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she showers upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.83,0:28:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那刻薄尖酸的味道再熟悉不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The acrid taste is well familiar, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.03,0:28:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们要学会忍耐 直到获得她丈夫的赞助\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we must learn swallow it, along with our pride{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.33,0:28:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我们将名利双收\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we have secured her husband's patronage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.33,0:28:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia已经为我们送来了Marcus Crassus\N{\fnArial\fs30}What need have we of Glaber, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.73,0:28:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对Glaber还能有何需求？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia delivers us Marcus Crassus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.20,0:28:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crassus的价值无可争议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus' wealth is undeniable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.60,0:28:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他目前只是空有议员的头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet he but holds the rank of senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.96,0:28:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Glaber的副将职位可有分量得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glaber outweighs with that of Legatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.50,0:28:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对名利双收的渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The favor of both coin and title{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.90,0:28:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,将加速实现我们的雄心\N{\fnArial\fs30}would speed our ambitions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.33,0:28:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了抬高你 就要让我下跪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To rise you would have me kneel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.50,0:28:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 我们会给Ilithyia\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day soon we will give Ilithyia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.53,0:28:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好上一节礼仪课\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lesson in manners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.76,0:29:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如今 现实需要我们将Crixus贡献于她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for now, necessity dictates we give her Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.96,0:29:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the arrangements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.33,0:29:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的高卢人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking Gaul…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.30,0:29:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想别的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn your thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.03,0:29:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,过不了多久我就会将他击败\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have at him soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.16,0:29:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望你的兄弟死掉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish your brother dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.20,0:29:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁放的狗屁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who speaks such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.26,0:29:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.33,0:29:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想护得他周全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only wish to protect him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.13,0:29:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在每个角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who will do so in the arena, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.86,0:29:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,都必须孤军奋战的竞技场 谁能做到呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}where every man must stand alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.76,0:29:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do him no favors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.36,0:29:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撒谎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.23,0:29:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.66,0:29:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.76,0:29:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 把你的谎言告诉他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Tell him you lie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.13,0:29:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已按钱办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what you paid me to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.33,0:29:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到他妻子的住处 但她不在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sought out his wife, but she was not there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.36,0:29:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他儿子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.66,0:29:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,空无一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.96,0:30:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是地面上有血迹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there were traces of blood on the floor and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.70,0:30:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,理智点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gain your senses!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.56,0:30:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill 'im.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.83,0:30:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.96,0:30:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.23,0:30:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁链砸不烂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will not break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.70,0:30:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.73,0:30:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,去和Batiatus谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak to Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.36,0:30:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.60,0:30:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能听进你说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have his ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.03,0:30:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕他让我离开这里一两天也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he would let me leave these walls for but a day or two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.83,0:30:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会允许的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would not allow it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.10,0:31:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都没试过 怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not even make attempt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.43,0:31:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只用锁链禁锢你 已经是侥幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are fortunate only to be chained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.73,0:31:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,向主人提出这等请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}To petition Dominus with such insanity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.50,0:31:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会招致更大的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}would only provoke further punishment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.56,0:31:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样如何能解决问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would that help your cause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.43,0:31:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cause is lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.86,0:31:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ashur只发现了血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur found only blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.73,0:31:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.36,0:31:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 你妻儿也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means your wife and child may{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.00,0:31:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet be living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.46,0:31:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,神啊 请惩罚我 饶了她们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods punish me, for failing them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.03,0:31:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,神才从来不理会傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods rarely take note of fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.50,0:31:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 别一味莽撞 也动下脑筋吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, pull head from ass and use it for once!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.46,0:31:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果受到袭击 你妻儿要逃到哪去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where would your wife and boy flee, if set upon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.76,0:31:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Naevia吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.26,0:31:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天色已晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hour is late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.03,0:31:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该回房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be in your cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.66,0:31:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could not sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.30,0:32:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脑海中一直浮想着竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mind is full of thoughts of the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.26,0:32:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽情享受沙场的时光吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embrace the sands of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.10,0:32:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着时间流逝 我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}As they flow, I harbor no doubt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.36,0:32:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将再次成为战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will again be a champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.50,0:32:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚已经有了自己的战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capua already has its champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.90,0:32:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达确实名副其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus bears the title, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.83,0:32:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我期待荣耀之人 重获战神之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I look towards a man of honor to regain it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.13,0:32:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你珍爱生命…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you value your life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.30,0:32:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不要吵醒角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}never awaken a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.80,0:32:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.66,0:32:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人派我来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina sent me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.90,0:32:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,从哪儿来 回哪儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return the way you came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.00,0:32:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要拒绝我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you refuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.26,0:33:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不诱人吗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I not pleasing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.00,0:33:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望同奉命行事的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no desire to lie with a woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.33,0:33:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,同床共枕\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has been commanded to do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.06,0:33:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不能服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you think will happen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.06,0:33:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得将会怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I fail such a command?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.26,0:33:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就留下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.76,0:33:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.06,0:33:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没什么我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there nothing I can do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.16,0:33:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为卡普亚战神效劳的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Champion of Capua?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.70,0:33:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还真有个忙想要你帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one desire I would have serviced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.16,0:33:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你可以的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are able…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.03,0:34:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早斯巴达爆发了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus breathes fire this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.20,0:34:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder to the cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.20,0:34:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mira啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mira.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.46,0:34:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我们战神的一夜春宵如何呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did your evening pass with our champion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.53,0:34:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.60,0:34:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,要了我很多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}many demands of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.70,0:34:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多次啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many demands, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.00,0:34:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的色雷斯人准备好交欢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Thracian is ready to stud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.16,0:34:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为此特殊一夜精心安排的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall make arrangements for this very night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.60,0:34:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而当太阳升起之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the sun rises, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.60,0:34:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就有接近Marcus Crassus的机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will have road to Marcus Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.16,0:34:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia呢？她对Crixus感不感兴趣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of Ilithyia, and her desire for Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.80,0:34:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经计划妥当了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already set plans in motion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.30,0:35:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小狗露出了牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pup bares his teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.53,0:35:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无睡意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep did not come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.66,0:35:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不应该有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor is it deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.50,0:35:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落之时 就能拥抱美梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embrace dreams when the sun falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.93,0:35:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.26,0:35:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关Aurelia的吗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aurelia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.26,0:35:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.90,0:35:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经派Mira\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have dispatched Mira, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.03,0:35:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名家奴 去找她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of the house slaves, to look for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.00,0:35:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.23,0:35:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你怎么做到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you manage such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.33,0:35:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被主人送来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was sent by Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.10,0:35:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To prepare me for certain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.50,0:35:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽战神的职责而磨好枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}duties required of a champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.16,0:36:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在 神都把女人抛给了你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the gods throw women at you, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.66,0:36:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh! Ahh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.26,0:36:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的状态回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your form returns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.93,0:36:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Hamilcar一对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pair with Hamilcar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.10,0:36:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来Duro丢下她弟弟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears Duro has lost his brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.93,0:36:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也比丢了脑袋要好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better that than his head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.90,0:36:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,事成了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.90,0:36:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经干掉Despoina那婊子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whore Despoina fucks no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.66,0:37:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我撕烂她喉咙时 也干掉了操她的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor the man inside her when I slit her throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.26,0:37:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那人不是Solonius\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not Solonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.36,0:37:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.86,0:37:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看的是谁的头？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose face do I look upon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.83,0:37:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kastor的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kastor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.56,0:37:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius的一个手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of Solonius' men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.26,0:37:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个带给Solonius\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send it to Solonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.93,0:37:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他尝尝死里逃生的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him savor the relief of escaping death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.30,0:37:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.00,0:37:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将和一位正宗的罗马女人上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be bedding a proper Roman woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.70,0:37:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的地位 你遥不可攀\N{\fnArial\fs30}One far above your station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.23,0:37:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话小心点 别惹恼了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heed my words, that you not offend her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.96,0:37:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.33,0:37:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也别说 也别出声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak not a word, nor make a sound, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.96,0:37:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着力气享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}save one of pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.10,0:37:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听从她的吩咐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow her lead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.53,0:38:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,揣摩她的想法 积极地满足她\N{\fnArial\fs30}anticipate her desires then fulfill them. Vigorously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.63,0:38:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.13,0:38:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在竞技场上 你是卡普亚的战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the arena, you are Champion of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.06,0:38:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今晚 你不过是个普通奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tonight, you a common slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.80,0:38:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听从吩咐\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do as commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.70,0:38:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,都懂了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.76,0:38:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are clear, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.63,0:38:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们会帮你安排妥当的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will prepare you for the festivities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.43,0:38:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待召见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait until summoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.66,0:38:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿最好的酒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch the best wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.63,0:38:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她过来的时候 要让我们的嘉宾能金枪不倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want our guest well plied when she arrives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.90,0:38:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.70,0:38:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,您昨晚在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.66,0:38:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等 差点被发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I waited almost to the point of detection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.06,0:38:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could not break away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.36,0:38:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在服侍主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was tending to Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.90,0:38:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是主人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.03,0:38:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是今天我看见的那个 和你一起的守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe that guard I saw you with today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.73,0:39:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄错了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are mistaken…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.10,0:39:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是瞎子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.36,0:39:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却在摩挲他的胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were touching his arm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.86,0:39:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈笑风生 而他注视你的眼神…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and laughing and the way he gazed at you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.00,0:39:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你真没瞎的话 那你就该清楚地看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are not blind, then you surely see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.16,0:39:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hector对所有女人都是同样的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Hector gazes at all women in the same fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.20,0:39:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我鸟都不鸟其他女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give no shit about other women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.53,0:39:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真丢我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shame me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.36,0:39:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自寻其辱 尽想着些虚构的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shame yourself, with thoughts of imaginary slights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.90,0:39:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我看见了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.60,0:39:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 你才没有！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You do not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.83,0:39:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然Hector也没有看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nor did Hector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.50,0:39:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的钥匙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}His key?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.10,0:39:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我调笑他的意图\N{\fnArial\fs30}The purpose of my smile and touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.30,0:39:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也只配得到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only one he received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.13,0:39:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能待一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have but a moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.26,0:40:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就必须把主人的酒带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I must return with Domina's wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.56,0:40:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好利用 为曾有的想法道歉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use it to apologize for ever thinking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.93,0:40:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是我的心脏…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are my heart…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.03,0:40:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再不会怀疑你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never doubt the beating of it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.50,0:43:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 抱歉 Licinia\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, apologies, Licinia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.50,0:43:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来 我们得等Idlithyia和斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We appear to have arrived before Ilithyia's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.00,0:43:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,做完之后才轮到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}finished with Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.13,0:43:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.46,0:43:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.96,0:44:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.10,0:44:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会不会在罗马的流言蜚语中风生水起啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}would this not set every tongue in Rome wagging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.23,0:44:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Claudius Glaber副将的妻子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wife of Legatus Claudius Glaber!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.50,0:44:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟斯巴达克斯交欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking Spartacus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.13,0:44:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而此人还曾经差点毁掉他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}the man that nearly ruined him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.50,0:44:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个丑闻 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a scandal, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.83,0:44:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我听过的最大丑闻啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most splendid I have ever heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.13,0:44:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别笑了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop laughing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.76,0:44:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别笑了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop laughing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.36,0:44:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再笑了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop Laughing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.66,0:44:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.86,0:45:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在想些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.00,0:45:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她处处蔑视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She slights me at every turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.13,0:45:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想教训她一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wished only to teach her a lesson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.93,0:45:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她和斯巴达克斯干么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By pairing her with Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.90,0:45:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我丈夫不能维护我的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my husband will not defend my honor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.66,0:45:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只好我自己来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am forced to do so myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.90,0:45:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣耀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.50,0:45:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以Marcus Crassus的表亲才会他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why the cousin to Marcus Crassus lays dead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.33,0:45:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,死在我们的房里了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in our fucking house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.66,0:45:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非我本意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was not my intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.36,0:45:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是本意也没关系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your intent matters for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.43,0:45:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.36,0:45:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大祸临头了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are undone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.00,0:45:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.06,0:45:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia一个人来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia came alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.40,0:45:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没跟任何人说起过此行\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told no one of her purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.50,0:45:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.66,0:45:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,连对她的奴隶都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even her slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.36,0:45:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要处理掉尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing to connect her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.73,0:45:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和Batiatus家族…\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the House of Batiatus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.93,0:45:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就再无任何瓜葛\N{\fnArial\fs30}once the body is disposed of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.76,0:45:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of Ilithyia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.86,0:45:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 交给我来处理吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'll take care of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.63,0:46:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你道歉 让你与Glaber的妻子交欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, It was an unfortunate mistake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.76,0:46:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全是个很不幸的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}coupling you with Glaber's wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.06,0:46:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并非我本意 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know that it was not my intent, nor of my knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.90,0:46:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是我道歉才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is I that owes apology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.63,0:46:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一时之间 我的手不再属于自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a moment my hands were not my own, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.43,0:46:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而属于那个不复存在的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but those of a man who no longer exists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.70,0:46:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就再别说起今晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us not speak of this night again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.93,0:46:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.06,0:46:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your loyalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.93,0:46:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为训练场争得了荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It honors this ludus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.16,0:46:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是有意的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.86,0:46:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 当然你并非本意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, course you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.70,0:46:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她取笑我的样子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way she laughed at me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.60,0:47:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我 是跟Crixus上床的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I was to lie with Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.06,0:47:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要给我斯巴达克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you give me Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.56,0:47:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you do such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.83,0:47:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ask what you already know answer to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.40,0:47:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫会因此羞愧死的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband will see me dead for this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.03,0:47:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死了我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have killed me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.00,0:47:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.63,0:47:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是把我们拉得更近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have brought us closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.63,0:47:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会知道今晚发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will ever know what happened here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.40,0:47:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Licinia的尸体永不会被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia's body will never be found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.80,0:47:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're protected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.23,0:47:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.33,0:47:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们终将知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.93,0:47:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会从我眼中看到实情\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will see the deed in my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.83,0:47:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就跟我呆在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you'll stay here with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.43,0:47:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你眼里一切澄明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until your eyes are clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.30,0:47:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论怎样掩饰 我们之间都存有差异\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had our differences, however veiled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.26,0:47:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我终于知道了 你是个多么有价值的朋友啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've come to see what a valuable friend you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.90,0:48:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是我们之间的小秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be our little secret.{\r}
